#. ja: まもり効果アップ
#. de: Verbessertes Phantom-Beschützen
#. fr: Défense améliorée
#. column 4: Improves <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Phantom Guard</ui-edge-color></ui-color>'s damage reduction effect to 90%.
msgctxt "MKDTrait:1:0:3"
msgid "Enhanced Phantom Guard"
msgstr "Усиленная защита фантома"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「まもり」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>の効果量を90％に上昇させる。
#. de: Erhöht den Effekt von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Phantom-Beschützen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf 90<nbsp>%.
#. fr: Augmente l'effet de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Défense</ui-edge-color></ui-color> à 90%.
#. column 3: Enhanced Phantom Guard
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:1:0:4"
msgid "Improves <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Phantom Guard</ui-edge-color></ui-color>'s damage reduction effect to 90%."
msgstr "Увеличивает снижение получаемого урона от эффекта <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Защиты фантома</ui-edge-color></ui-color> до 90%."

#. ja: いのり効果アップ
#. de: Verbessertes Beten
#. fr: Prière améliorée
#. column 4: Increases the healing potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Pray</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 5,000.
msgctxt "MKDTrait:2:0:3"
msgid "Enhanced Pray"
msgstr "Усиленная молитва"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「いのり」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>の回復力を5000に上昇させる。
#. de: Erhöht die Heilwirkung von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Beten</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf 5.000.
#. fr: Augmente la puissance de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Prière</ui-edge-color></ui-color> à 5000.
#. column 3: Enhanced Pray
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:2:0:4"
msgid "Increases the healing potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Pray</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 5,000."
msgstr "Увеличивает силу лечения от эффекта <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Молитвы</ui-edge-color></ui-color> до 5000."

#. ja: あばれる効果アップ
#. de: Verbessertes Wüten
#. fr: Fureur améliorée
#. column 4: Grants the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Pent-up Rage</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, increasing the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Deadly Blow</ui-edge-color></ui-color> based on the amount of damage you have taken while the effect is active.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s
msgctxt "MKDTrait:3:0:3"
msgid "Enhanced Rage"
msgstr "Усиленная ярость"

#. ja: 自身に<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「肉斬骨断」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>が付与される。<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「肉斬骨断」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>効果中に受けたダメージ量によって、いちげきの威力が増加する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Gewährt dir <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durch Mark und Bein</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Effekt von <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durch Mark und Bein</ui-edge-color></ui-color>: Je mehr Schaden während der Effektdauer erlitten wird, desto höher der Attacke-Wert von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Todesstoß</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Dauer: 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Permet de recevoir <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Brutalité</ui-edge-color></ui-color> lorsque vous utilisez <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fureur</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Brutalité<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> plus des dégâts sont subis pendant la durée de l'effet, plus la puissance de la prochaine action <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Frappes brutales</ui-edge-color></ui-color> augmente.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. column 3: Enhanced Rage
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:3:0:4"
msgid "Grants the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Pent-up Rage</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, increasing the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Deadly Blow</ui-edge-color></ui-color> based on the amount of damage you have taken while the effect is active.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s"
msgstr "Даёт эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Сдерживаемой ярости</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Сила <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Смертельного удара</ui-edge-color></ui-color> растёт в зависимости от урона, полученного под этим эффектом.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15 сек."

