msgid "Enhanced Iainuki"
msgstr "Усиленный Иайнуки"

#. ja: いあいぬきの威力を500に上昇させる。さらに即死の確率を10％に上昇させる。
#. de: Erhöht den Attacke-Wert von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Iainuki</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf 500 und gewährt eine Chance von 10<nbsp>% auf den sofortigen Tod des Gegners.
#. fr: Augmente la puissance de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Iainuki</ui-edge-color></ui-color> à 500 et les chances d'infliger Mort à 10%.
#. column 3: Enhanced Iainuki
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:8:0:4"
msgid "Increases the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Iainuki</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 500, and increases chance to instantly kill target to 10%."
msgstr "Увеличивает силу <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Иайнуки</ui-edge-color></ui-color> до 500, а шанс мгновенно убить цель — до 10%."

#. ja: うた効果アップ
#. de: Verbessertes Singen
#. fr: Chants améliorés
#. column 4: Increases the effectiveness of songs in accordance with your Phantom Bard level.
msgctxt "MKDTrait:9:0:3"
msgid "Enhanced Vocals"
msgstr "Усиленное пение"

#. ja: うたの効果量をサポート吟遊詩人のサポートジョブレベルに応じて上昇させる。
#. de: Erhöht die Effekte deiner Lieder skalierend mit der Stufe deines Phantom-Barden.
#. fr: Augmente l'effet de certains chants en fonction du niveau de job de soutien de barde fantôme.
#. column 3: Enhanced Vocals
msgctxt "MKDTrait:9:0:4"
msgid "Increases the effectiveness of songs in accordance with your Phantom Bard level."
msgstr "Повышает эффективность песен в зависимости от уровня фантомного барда."

#. ja: かぎあけ
#. de: Schlüsselmeister
#. fr: Passe-partout
#. column 4: Allows you to open locked doors in dungeons.
msgctxt "MKDTrait:10:0:3"
msgid "Lockpicker"
msgstr "Взломщик замков"

#. ja: ダンジョン内にある鍵のかかった扉を開けることができるようになる。
#. de: Erlaubt dir das Öffnen von verschlossenen Türen in Dungeons.
#. fr: Permet d'ouvrir toutes les portes verrouillées dans un donjon.
#. column 3: Lockpicker
msgctxt "MKDTrait:10:0:4"
msgid "Allows you to open locked doors in dungeons."
msgstr "Позволяет открывать запертые двери в подземельях."

