msgid "Enhanced Phantom Fire"
msgstr "Усиленный огонь фантома"

#. ja: ほうげきの実行時、5％の確率で一部の対象を即死させる。
#. de: Gewährt eine Chance von 5<nbsp>% auf den sofortigen Tod fast aller Gegner.
#. fr: Accorde 5% de chances d'infliger Mort à certaines cibles lors de l'utilisation de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Tir</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. column 3: Enhanced Phantom Fire
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
