#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:11:0:4"
msgid "Grants a 5% chance to instantly kill targets when executing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Phantom Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, with some exceptions."
msgstr "При использовании <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Огня фантома</ui-edge-color></ui-color> даёт 5% шанс мгновенно убить цель. Не действует на некоторые цели."

#. ja: ベル効果アップ
#. de: Verbessertes Läuten
#. fr: Cloches améliorées
#. column 4: Increases the effectiveness of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Battle Bell</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 5%, and increases the healing potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ringing Respite</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 3,000.
