#. ja: せんせいこうげき
#. de: Erstschlag
#. fr: Préséance
#. column 4: Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>First Strike</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when entering combat.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>First Strike Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay are reduced<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>25s
