msgctxt "MKDTrait:13:0:4"
msgid "Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>First Strike</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when entering combat.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>First Strike Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay are reduced<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>25s"
msgstr "При вступлении в бой даёт эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Первого удара</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Эффект Первого удара: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Сокращает время применения и перезарядки оружейных приёмов и заклинаний, а также задержку автоатак.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>25 сек."

#. ja: マギ・ジャンプ効果アップ
#. de: Verbesserter Kreszenter Sprung
#. fr: Magi Saut amélioré
#. column 4: Increases potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Jump</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 500, and increases potency of reduced damage taken effect to 90%.
msgctxt "MKDTrait:14:0:3"
msgid "Enhanced Occult Jump"
msgstr "Усиленный тайный прыжок"

#. ja: マギ・ジャンプの威力が500に上昇し、さらに被ダメージ低下の効果量が90％になる。
#. de: Erhöht den Attacke-Wert von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszenter Sprung</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf 500 und die Verringerung des erlittenen Schadens auf 90<nbsp>%.
#. fr: Augmente la puissance de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Magi Saut</ui-edge-color></ui-color> à 500 et son effet de réduction de dégâts à 90%.
#. column 3: Enhanced Occult Jump
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:14:0:4"
msgid "Increases potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Jump</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 500, and increases potency of reduced damage taken effect to 90%."
msgstr "Увеличивает силу <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Тайного прыжка</ui-edge-color></ui-color> до 500, а снижение получаемого урона — до 90%."

#. ja: マギ・ラーニングI
#. de: Kreszentes Erlernen I
#. fr: Magi Apprentissage I
#. column 4: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Missile</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Aqua Breath</ui-edge-color></ui-color> are now learnable actions.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Missile Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Delivers an attack with a 35% chance to deal damage equal to 75% of target's current HP, with some exceptions<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Occult Aqua Breath Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Deals unaspected damage to target and all enemies nearby it
msgctxt "MKDTrait:15:0:3"
msgid "Occult Learning I"
msgstr "Тайное обучение I"

#. ja: マギ・ミサイル、マギ・アクアブレスがラーニング可能となる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>マギ・ミサイル効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>一部の対象に35％の確率で現在ＨＰの75％分のダメージ。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>マギ・アクアブレス効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>対象とその周囲の敵に無属性範囲魔法攻撃。
#. de: Erlaubt es, <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszente Rakete</ui-edge-color></ui-color> und <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszenter Aqua-Atem</ui-edge-color></ui-color> zu erlernen.<br>Effekt von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszente Rakete</ui-edge-color></ui-color>: Fügt den meisten Gegnern mit einer Wahr<shy>schein<shy>lich<shy>keit von 35<nbsp>% Schaden in Höhe von 75<nbsp>% der aktuellen LP zu.<br>Effekt von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszenter Aqua-Atem</ui-edge-color></ui-color>: Du führst eine elementneutrale magische Attacke auf das Ziel und die Gegner in seiner Nähe aus.
#. fr: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Magi Missile</ui-edge-color></ui-color> et <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Magi Aquasouffle</ui-edge-color></ui-color> peuvent être appris.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Magi Missile<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 35% de chances d'infliger à certaines cibles un montant de dégâts égal à 75% des PV maximums.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Magi Aquasouffle<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effectue une attaque magique neutre sur la cible et les ennemis autour.
#. column 3: Occult Learning I
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
