#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MKDTrait:15:0:4"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Missile</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Aqua Breath</ui-edge-color></ui-color> are now learnable actions.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Missile Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Delivers an attack with a 35% chance to deal damage equal to 75% of target's current HP, with some exceptions<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Occult Aqua Breath Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Deals unaspected damage to target and all enemies nearby it"
msgstr "Теперь можно изучить умения <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Тайная ракета</ui-edge-color></ui-color> и <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Тайное водяное дыхание</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Эффект ракеты: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Атакует цель с вероятностью 35% нанести урон в размере 75% её текущих HP. Не действует на некоторые цели.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Эффект тайного водяного дыхания: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Наносит беспредельный урон цели и всем врагам поблизости."

#. ja: マギ・ラーニングII
#. de: Kreszentes Erlernen II
#. fr: Magi Apprentissage II
#. column 4: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Aero II</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Occult Mighty Guard</ui-edge-color></ui-color> are now learnable actions.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Occult Aero II Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Deals wind damage to target<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Occult Mighty Guard Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Reduces damage taken by self and nearby party members by 20%
msgctxt "MKDTrait:16:0:3"
msgid "Occult Learning II"
msgstr "Тайное обучение II"

#. ja: マギ・エアロラ、マギ・マイティガードがラーニング可能となる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>マギ・エアロラ効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>対象に風属性魔法攻撃。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>マギ・マイティガード効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>一定時間、自身と周囲のパーティメンバーの被ダメージを20％軽減させる。
#. de: Erlaubt es, <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszentes Windra</ui-edge-color></ui-color> und <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszente Totalabwehr</ui-edge-color></ui-color> zu erlernen.<br>Effekt von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszentes Windra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>: Du führst eine windbasierte magische Attacke aus.<br>Effekt von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Kreszente Totalabwehr</ui-edge-color></ui-color>: Verringert zeitweise den eigenen sowie den erlittenen Schaden von Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>gliedern um 20<nbsp>%.
#. fr: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Magi Extra Vent</ui-edge-color></ui-color> et <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Magi Garde puissante</ui-edge-color></ui-color> peuvent être appris.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Magi Extra Vent<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effectue une attaque magique de vent sur la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Magi Garde puissante<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> réduit de 20% les dégâts reçus par vous et les équipiers alentour.
#. column 3: Occult Learning II
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
